          "children": [
            {
              "id": "intro-copy",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 8
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "intro-h",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Leasing is the transportation solution you cannot afford to ignore.",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "eyebrow": "Lease & rental"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "intro-t1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Commercial truck ownership is getting more challenging and costly to manage every day. For most well-run businesses, leasing is a superior financial and operational alternative. Idealease offers a variety of comprehensive support services that allow you to manage your business more effectively and hassle-free than ever before.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "intro-t2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Lease or purchase a semi-truck? You have those options, as well as the option to rent. If you do not want to buy outright, semi-truck and trailer rentals or semi-truck leasing may be more appropriate for your needs. As well as traditional semi-truck leasing to cover ownership for several years, we also offer semi-truck and trailer rentals for shorter periods.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "intro-t3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Rechtien Truck Group, we deliver professional semi truck leasing solutions to businesses across South Carolina, with a portfolio of commercial trucks for rent that includes the latest International trucks and 18-wheelers. In South Florida, Rechtien Truck Group works with Idealease of South Florida to help you choose a truck lease or rental that more than meets your needs.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "intro-logo",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 4
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "intro-logo-img",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/logos/idealease.png",
                      "alt": "Idealease truck leasing and rental logo"
                    },
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "intro-logo-cap",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Leasing and rentals through Idealease, in South Florida and South Carolina.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
