                  "id": "options-t2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Idealease of South Florida offers full-service semi truck leasing, dedicated maintenance and mobile service. With specialized technicians and over 50 service bays, leasing agreements can include full-service maintenance, licensing, fuel tax reporting and washing. We also offer high-speed diesel fueling at competitive prices, along with an electronic “card lock” system that allows 24-hour fueling and customer reporting.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
