              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "options-grid",
                  "type": "list",
                  "props": {
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "columns": 4,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "label": "Full Service Lease",
                        "desc": "Get the vehicle specs you need, predictable costs for all vehicle maintenance, Priority Service, and 24/7 Roadside Assistance."
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Full Service Equity Lease",
                        "desc": "The perfect solution for companies that must own their commercial vehicles for tax purposes. Retain tax ownership and establish equity in your fleet while receiving all the benefits of a Full Service Lease."
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Ownership Transition",
                        "desc": "Unlock the equity that is tied up in your truck fleet and put cash back into your business. Learn the true cost of truck ownership versus the advantages of a fleet buyout and a Full Service Lease."
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Dedicated Maintenance",
                        "desc": "Customized dedicated truck maintenance, Priority Service, and a fixed monthly cost for scheduled preventive and unscheduled maintenance."
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "National Accounts",
                        "desc": "Idealease offers a comprehensive range of integrated fleet transportation solutions that allow large national and mid-sized regional fleets to improve service to their customers. All Idealease locations work together as one to support and maintain your fleet, so you can operate more efficiently and cost-effectively across all your locations."
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "IdealNet",
                        "desc": "24/7 Roadside Assistance is available at more than 430 Idealease locations. The service is provided in-house by trained Idealease staff members."
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Idealease Fleet Services",
                        "desc": "Vehicle legalization and fuel tax reporting in the U.S. The no-fee Idealease Fleet Services Fuel Card eliminates much of the paperwork for tracking, trip reports and fuel tax receipts, and is accepted at more than 43,000 fueling locations in North America."
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Safety & Compliance",
